  "id": "sweet-tangy-soy-tamarind-sauce",
  "name": "Sweet-Tangy Soy Tamarind Sauce",
  "subtitle": "A balanced Japanese-style sauce for noodles, rice, or vegetables",
  "description": "Warm soy sauce, tamarind, vinegar, and ketchup combine with sugar for a glossy sweet-sour condiment.",
